# TZ-257 — Admin module (Users / Roles / Permissions)

**Дата создания:** 2026-07-31
**Автор:** senior-orchestrator
**Приоритет:** MEDIUM (consumers — TZ-258 onboarding contract)
**ЗАВИСИМОСТИ:** TZ-258 (Onboarding contract consumed), TZ-256 (capability guards)
**LAYER:** 3 (frontend) + 4 (backend surface)
**CONFLICT KEYS:**
- backend/src/modules/admin/admin.module.ts (NEW) — guards, controllers
- backend/src/modules/admin/users-admin.controller.ts (NEW)
- backend/src/modules/admin/roles-admin.controller.ts (NEW)
- backend/src/modules/admin/dto/mapper.ts (NEW) — DTO mappers
- backend/src/common/guards/last-admin.guard.ts (NEW) — last-admin invariant
