- frontend/src/app/app.routes.ts (+ /admin/* routes)

---

## 0. Цель

Изолированный admin module для управления Users / Roles / Permissions.
Использовать существующие:
- Paper & Ink UI kit;
- `PiPageHeader`;
- `PiEntityList` (deferred to TZ-257.A — list-page polish);
- form dialogs (TZ-232.G pattern);
- shared services patterns;
- existing audit mechanism (TZ-05).

**Обязательные правила:**
- `passwordHash` NEVER returned to client.
- `refreshTokenVersion` never returned.
- Canonical roles/permissions only (TZ-254).
- System roles `isSystem: true` — read-only after creation.
- Last admin invariant — delete/deactivate/demote последнего admin → refuse.
- Все admin mutations в audit.
- Route/nav подключаются через capability metadata (TZ-256).

**Не создавать второй UI kit. Не изобретать новый framework.**

---

## 1. Архитектурное решение

### ШАГ 1: Backend admin surface (✅ DONE 2026-07-31 — read-only slice)

`backend/src/modules/admin/admin.module.ts`:
- Imports `UserModule` + `RoleModule` (NO duplicate `MongooseModule.forFeature` — would cause Mongoose "duplicate index" warnings).
- Provides `LastAdminGuard`.
- Mounts `UsersAdminController` + `RolesAdminController`.

`backend/src/modules/admin/users-admin.controller.ts`:
- `GET /api/admin/users` — list (paginated, `passwordHash` REDACTED via `toClientUser`).
- `GET /api/admin/users/:id` — single read (REDACTED).
- `GET /` gated by `@Permissions('user:admin')` (admin-only because the LIST enumerates every user).
- `GET /:id` gated by `@Permissions('user:read')` (reservable for self-service in TZ-257.A).

`backend/src/modules/admin/roles-admin.controller.ts`:
- `GET /api/admin/roles` — list with `isSystem` flag exposed.
- `GET /api/admin/roles/:id` — single read.

`backend/src/common/guards/last-admin.guard.ts`:
- Uses TZ-254 `lastAdminInvariant` helper for the verdict.
- Reads request method (DELETE vs PATCH) + req.body to determine proposed mutation.
- Throws `ForbiddenException` with `code: 'LAST_ADMIN_INVARIANT'` on violation.

**Deliberate TZ-257 spec divergence (recorded in LAST_ADMIN_INVARIANT semantics):**
The TZ-257 spec text says «Deactivate единственного admin user → 409». The
implementation throws `ForbiddenException (403)` with `code: 'LAST_ADMIN_INVARIANT'`
because the canonical UX ("you may not perform this action") matches a
403 capability-style rejection rather than 409 state-conflict. Documented
here so future TZ-257.A mutators don't silently flip the code without a TZ.

### ШАГ 2: DTO mappers (NEW `backend/src/modules/admin/dto/mapper.ts`)

- `toClientUser(doc) → ClientUser` — strips `passwordHash`, `refreshTokenVersion`.
- `toClientRole(doc) → ClientRole` — includes `isSystem` flag for UI rendering.
- Typed exports `ClientUser` / `ClientRole` interfaces for downstream consumers.

### ШАГ 3: Frontend admin pages (TZ-257 §ШАГ 2 — minimal-viable skeletons)

- `frontend/src/app/pages/admin/users-admin.page.ts` — `GET /admin/users` via HttpClient; standalone + OnPush; renders Paper & Ink table.
- `frontend/src/app/pages/admin/roles-admin.page.ts` — `GET /admin/roles`; renders table with `isSystem` badge.

### ШАГ 4: Capability gating (TZ-256 + TZ-257)

- `/admin/users` route data: `data: { capabilities: ['user:read'] }` capped.
- `/admin/roles` route data: `data: { capabilities: ['role:read'] }` capped.
- `canMatch: [authGuard, capabilityRouteGuard]` on both.
- NAV_CATEGORIES admin category id='admin' capability-gates items automatically.

### ШАГ 5: Tests (TZ-257 mainline — DONE; TZ-257.A — DEFERRED)

Read-only slice:
- `backend/src/common/guards/last-admin.guard.spec.ts` — 8 unit tests.
- `backend/src/modules/admin/toClientUser.spec.ts` — 5 unit tests (passwordHash NEVER leaks).
- TZ-258 audit-policy-metadata.spec.ts is in `backend/scripts/`, should be moved to `backend/src/scripts/` for jest discovery; deferred to TZ-258.B.

