## 4. Критерии приёмки (DONE — read-only slice)

1. `GET /api/admin/users` → response has NO `passwordHash` field (5 spec tests verify).
2. `GET /api/admin/users/:id` → response NO `refreshTokenVersion` (5 spec tests verify).
3. Last-admin invariant spec: LastAdminGuard rejects delete of the only active admin (3 spec tests verify).
4. Permission gate: LIST gated by 'user:admin'; :id gated by 'user:read'.
5. Compilation passes (backend typecheck EXIT 0; frontend typecheck EXIT 0).
6. Baselines unaffected: TZ-248/249/251/254/255 all PASS.

